{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8f67fe02c44d482732dac4d30ab2af1049182217af4dfb867260786be174f71c", "ja": "（紗代子と瑞希はアンバサダーとして、\n大規模なゲームイベントのステージを盛り上げた……）", "zh": "（纱代子和瑞希作为大使，让大型游戏活动的舞台现场热闹非凡……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1001_se", "source_sha256": "99735e245709f19986f828952f20b52b4f0b6ac7c15944e49a0b2b3ae10cc4a0", "ja": "ワアアアアアアッ！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "510d7e6c1cf39dc54857e6a12acc7387657da750444a297b4976897139082599", "ja": "ふぅ～。制限時間内にボスを倒せてよかったね！\n瑞希ちゃんが居なかったら、絶対に無理だったよ。", "zh": "呼～。能在限定时间内打倒Boss，真是太好了！\n要是没有瑞希，一定做不到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "163ef5ef296afd5772da42a2c446bc4a5db7e13c604f016ecd49e01314765f5e", "ja": "何度かリトライすることにはなりましたが、\n無事にリベンジ達成です……ぶい。", "zh": "虽然重试了好几次，但总算成功复仇了……胜利。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d8bcbff59f003e4ff8d4f6cf6ff1b3f1d0b0e27f34b0ea4c4226d23634a7dcda", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れ様。手に汗握る協力プレイで\n会場のお客さんも大盛り上がりだ！", "zh": "你们两个都辛苦了。刚才那场让人捏一把汗的合作游戏，让现场的观众也彻底嗨起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "c3f69ff5393c5ffdf71e62cc15a5678185c6ba4823d09022b37b06585785d771", "ja": "そのようですね。それにしても、高山さんの成長には\n驚きました。最後のプレイは冴え渡ってましたね。", "zh": "看来确实如此。不过话说回来，高山小姐的成长真是令人惊讶。\n最后的操作发挥得淋漓尽致呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "0795ad8b9e17f89e4314bdf0a8ec28bb2555c86f39df2073515ad8252892efd7", "ja": "うん。何度もやってるうちに、調子が出てきたみたい。\nこの日のために、特訓した甲斐があったね！", "zh": "嗯。多玩了几次之后，感觉就逐渐进入状态了。\n为了今天进行特训果然没白费呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ccedddbdf355ef0fab44e330567693351c3b66c35397945e91718c4ddfe8605d", "ja": "最初は瑞希に勝てないことも多かったからな。本当に\nすごい成長……ハッ。もしかして、自主練してたのか？", "zh": "一开始输给瑞希的情况也挺多的。真的成长了不少……哎。该不会是自己私下练习了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "f8af09c1a0f012d038b383e894482ff7327145d2253821c05dc3117d8d21457c", "ja": "あっ……はい。アンバサダーを任せてもらったからには\nカッコよくゲームができるようになりたいなって。", "zh": "啊……是的。既然让我担任了大使，\n我就想着，至少要努力做到能帅气地玩游戏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "bed9807b2c7209217bed03b6162273360ff11ea8070a3ddb690793ce50c04a71", "ja": "瑞希ちゃんは、すごく上手だったし……\n私が足を引っ張るわけにはいきませんから！", "zh": "瑞希她玩得特别好……我可不能拖后腿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "daef1370bf43927f7cbb11b91c83f752cf889594c57c617f43d1dabc84937c2e", "ja": "さすがです、高山さん。そのおかげで、今や立派な\n相棒です。安心して、背中を預けられたぞ。", "zh": "不愧是高山小姐。多亏了你，如今已经是出色的搭档了。  \n我可以放心地把后背交给你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f3c3ce7e2dd212615d35366301f45ed482aa8080444a9fd84f58fb2e19ea7a02", "ja": "ああ。息の合ったプレイは、見てて気持ちよかったよ。\nお互いが信頼しあってる感じがしてね。", "zh": "啊，配合默契的表现看着真让人舒服。感觉你们彼此都很信任对方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "96602715e24fb7fec0877bb4ffc8cb6b1c8e2eb2d15f24aa84dc1a9060462610", "ja": "わぁっ、本当ですか？　ふふっ、じゃあ今の私なら……\n対戦モードでも、瑞希ちゃんといい勝負ができるかも！", "zh": "哇，真的吗？　呵呵，那现在的我的话……  \n说不定在对战模式里，也能和瑞希来一场势均力敌的比赛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "2ec586b3bfe6bdc47234db193b768244287abbc54a21585c1992d2fbe827785c", "ja": "ふむ……私もその勝負に興味があります。\nわかりました。受けて立ちましょう。", "zh": "嗯……我也对那场较量感兴趣。\n明白了。那就放马过来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1015_p", "source_sha256": "69af9b8182d2a2f33ca7672ba395edffcb6fc43cfba622a5ddf66c2e768b9194", "ja": "……えっ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "556d32585181f6b7a8afbcda9dc93f59fd44d0bb34b7b1bc15e0bdfc4ad9d9e1", "ja": "ですがアンバサダーは、ゲームの腕だけでなく……\nプレイ中のトークも重要です。", "zh": "不过，大使不仅要有游戏实力……游戏时的谈话也很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "4ae5a8fe980d600c19c70ad6aa5e2a079fb7a0a6e1b0cd27067ecb2466742078", "ja": "ということで、対戦の際にもトークをしてみて、\nその良し悪しも勝負に含めるのはいかがでしょう。", "zh": "所以，要不要在对战时也聊聊天，把聊得好不好也纳入胜负考量呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "0cca9d8a7163bf1ec1401d2741bc38e2191f54dc7ca22296d33b4635db01cfe0", "ja": "確かに……！　じゃあ総合的に見てもらって、\n{$P$}にジャッジしてもらおう！", "zh": "确实……！那就请大家综合来看，\n让{$P$}来做裁判吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1019_p", "source_sha256": "9f44276588de7289ca74c4e3f093cda5210ae83379853a2896e732d9cc30feb4", "ja": "ええっ！？\nなんか、さらりと大事な役目を任せられたような……。", "zh": "诶诶！？\n总觉得好像被轻描淡写地托付了什么重要任务……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "3667db2503c264ab54d3b0872389bf928c336d7e4a40a99624691f27fe8255ab", "ja": "では、よろしくお願いします。……ナンバーワン\nアンバサダーの称号は、高山さんに渡さないぞ。", "zh": "那么，就拜托你了。……头号大使的称号，我可不会让给高山小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "a5fbfccbf5dad8afbe361a476b77d64bd6af744db838372042205d5bf069ebb5", "ja": "私だって負けないよ！　{$P$}、\n私たちのこと、しっかり見ていてくださいねっ！", "zh": "我也不会输的！{$P$}，请好好看着我们哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0414_1022_p", "source_sha256": "e5dac18fa99f373e4f40ddda76a98256a716ebf0e6d57a02c14f2ef1b89565f2", "ja": "（お互いに刺激し合う、いい関係だな。瑞希と紗代子の\n熱気で、この後のイベントも盛り上がりそうだ！）", "zh": "（彼此互相激励，这种关系真不错啊。瑞希和纱代子的热情，肯定也会让接下来的活动更加热闹！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
